1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A supplier borrows ₩80M from Lender A
against a ₩100M invoice

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
It takes the same invoice to Lender B —
who can't see Lender A's books

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One invoice. ₩160M paid out.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Three separate companies:
the supplier, Lender A, Lender B

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
The lenders never see each other's books.
All they share is the public ledger below

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The supplier picks invoice #1 (face value ₩100M)

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
It chooses what to disclose.
The buyer's name isn't even an option

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Lender A: paid out.
Vault ₩1.0B → ₩0.92B

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Pick the same invoice again —
the apply button is disabled

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Lender B's vault stays at ₩1.0B —
without ever seeing Lender A's books

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The public ledger holds a nullifier and an amount.
Not a word of the invoice

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Six attacks, run live.
Green 'pass' = the defence held (local circuit run)

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:26,000
A1–A2: re-encoded or re-sealed —
same nullifier, rejected

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,000
A3–A4: inflated amount or someone else's invoice —
not attested by the issuer, rejected

15
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:44,000
A5: apply to both lenders at once —
only one loan goes out (₩40M)

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
A6: a request prepared early and sent late
is re-checked at execution — rejected

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
All six held. The only money that moved
is the one legitimate loan in A5

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:08,000
The same contract is live
on Midnight Preprod

19
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:16,000
We ran A6 on-chain on a rehearsal contract.
Lender A's loan: block 2714409, SUCCESS

20
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Then Lender B's pre-built request was submitted:
block 2714417, PARTIAL_SUCCESS

21
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Only the fee went through — the chain rejected the loan.
Lender B's vault is unchanged

22
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:43,000
No shared books.
No double financing.

23
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Limitation: the on-chain A5 race needs two wallets
and hasn't been tested on-chain yet
